0.05    = Verlet:          Verlet distance for optimization
0       = RenderVideo:     Write XDMF output if 1
0.9     = fraction:        Fraction of particles to appear
1.0e4   = Kn:              Normal stiffness
1.0e4   = Kt:              Tangential stiffness
0.1     = Gn:              Normal dissipative coefficient
0.0     = Gt:              Tangential dissipative coefficient
0.2     = Mu:              Microscopic friction coefficient
0.1     = R:               Sphere radius
0.9     = RRatio:          Radius ratio (1.0 = monodisperse, <1 = min/max radius ratio)
1000    = seed:            Random seed of the dompargen packing
5.0e-5  = dt:              Time step
0.1     = dtOut:           Output interval
2.0     = Lx:              Initial periodic cell length (x)
2.0     = Ly:              Initial periodic cell width  (y)
2.0     = Lz:              Initial periodic cell height (z)
2.6     = rho:             Particle density
50.0    = pressure:        Isotropic target pressure
2.0     = isotropicEnd:    End time for isotropic compression
0.002   = axialStrainRate: Axial strain rate during shear (positive compresses)
4.0     = shearEnd:        Absolute end time for the triaxial shear phase
0.5     = pidKp:           Proportional gain (normalized stress error -> strain rate)
0.0     = pidKi:           Integral gain
0.0     = pidKd:           Derivative gain
